{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2022-02-22 09:01:00', 'title': 'WORLEY, ABB, AND IBM TO COLLABORATE TO CREATE AN END-TO-END GREEN HYDROGEN SOLUTION', 'text': 'SYDNEY AND ZURICH AND ARMONK, N.Y., FEB. 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0WORLEY\xa0(ASX: WOR), ABB (ABBN: SIX SWISS EX) AND IBM (NYSE: IBM) HAVE SIGNED A MEMORANDUM OF UNDERSTANDING TO COLLABORATE ON HELPING ENERGY COMPANIES BUILD AND OPERATE GREEN HYDROGEN FACILITIES MORE EFFICIENTLY AND AT SCALE.'}